{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type Modifier = \n  | \"Control\"\n  | \"Ctrl\"\n  | \"Shift\"\n  | \"Alt\"\n  | \"Option\"\n  | \"Command\"\n  | \"Cmd\"\n  | \"CommandOrControl\"\n  | \"Mod\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key.types.ts#L11","children":[{"type":"text","value":"key.types.ts:11"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All supported modifier key names, including aliases."}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Control/Ctrl: The Control key"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Shift: The Shift key"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Alt/Option: The Alt key (Option on macOS)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Command/Cmd: The Command key (macOS only)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"CommandOrControl/Mod: Command on macOS, Control on other platforms"}]}]}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype Modifier = \n  | \"Control\"\n  | \"Ctrl\"\n  | \"Shift\"\n  | \"Alt\"\n  | \"Option\"\n  | \"Command\"\n  | \"Cmd\"\n  | \"CommandOrControl\"\n  | \"Mod\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [key.types.ts:11](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key.types.ts#L11)\n\nAll supported modifier key names, including aliases.\n- Control/Ctrl: The Control key\n- Shift: The Shift key\n- Alt/Option: The Alt key (Option on macOS)\n- Command/Cmd: The Command key (macOS only)\n- CommandOrControl/Mod: Command on macOS, Control on other platforms\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: Modifier\ntitle: Modifier\n---\n\n```ts\ntype Modifier = \n  | \"Control\"\n  | \"Ctrl\"\n  | \"Shift\"\n  | \"Alt\"\n  | \"Option\"\n  | \"Command\"\n  | \"Cmd\"\n  | \"CommandOrControl\"\n  | \"Mod\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [key.types.ts:11](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key.types.ts#L11)\n\nAll supported modifier key names, including aliases.\n- Control/Ctrl: The Control key\n- Shift: The Shift key\n- Alt/Option: The Alt key (Option on macOS)\n- Command/Cmd: The Command key (macOS only)\n- CommandOrControl/Mod: Command on macOS, Control on other platforms\n"}
